  << /ActualText (I am a dynamic and strategic Product Designer with 6\053 years of experience specializing in UI\057UX design and end\055to\055end product development\056 Currently driving innovative digital products at Qwipo\054 a product\055based company\054 with a strong focus on building scalable workflows and seamless user experiences\056\050\nExperienced in collaborating with stakeholders to gather requirements\054 creating user stories\054 and translating PRDs and API documentation into intuitive\054 high\055impact frontend designs\056 I take ownership of products from concept to execution\054 applying system thinking\054 usability principles\054 and rapid prototyping approaches to deliver efficient and user\055centric solutions\056\050\nPassionate about mastering UI\057UX\054 CX design\054 and design psychology while expanding expertise in AI\055driven design\054 product strategy\054 and design\055to\055code workflows\054 with a long\055term vision of moving into leadership and building impactful digital products\056)
